\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. O Lord of life, Thy quickening voice
\par Awakes my morning song;
\par In gladsome words I would rejoice
\par That I to Thee belong.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. I see Thy light, I feel Thy wind,
\par The world, it is Thy word;
\par Whatever wakes my heart and mind,
\par Thy presence is, my Lord.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3
\par \cf0\ulnone\b0 3. Therefore I choose my highest part,
\par And turn my face to Thee;
\par Therefore I stir my inmost heart
\par To worship fervently.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Lord, let me live and will this day,
\par Keep rising from the dead;
\par Lord, make my spirit good and gay,
\par Give  me my daily bread.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5. WIthin my heart, speak, Lord, speak on,
\par My heart alive to keep,
\par Till comes the night, and, labour done
\par In Thee I fall asleep.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b 
\par }

